            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "size": 1851,
            "text": "{\"task_id\":\"f2c112e6-12cc-4aaa-8bb5-5d57c01cf79b\",\"metadata\":{\"prompt\":\"The cat slowly blinks and turns its head toward the window.\",\"model_prompt\":\"How the reference pictures align with the target video - Picture 1 (from Shot 1) aligns with the 0.00-second mark of the target video; Picture 2 (from Shot 1) aligns with the 4.00-second mark of the target video.\\n\\nintegrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic, the white cat with mismatched blue and yellow eyes begins in the seated posture and profile framing established by Picture 1 on the green lawn. The camera pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed toward the cat's face. As the seconds progress, the cat slowly closes its eyelids into a gentle blink and opens them again, then smoothly pivots its head forward until it centers into the extreme close-up head-on framing, exact eye gaze, fur texture, and composition established by Picture 2 at the end of the shot.\\n\\noverall_soundscape: Soft outdoor breeze rustles through the grass and nearby foliage with light ambient birdsong in the background.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A\",\"prompt_expansion_elapsed_ms\":1819,\"prompt_enhancement_level\":null,\"model\":\"MiniMax-H3-MultiMax\",\"task_type\":\"I2V\",\"seed\":740802,\"fps\":null,\"height\":480,\"width\":864,\"aspect_ratio\":\"16:9\",\"resolution_label\":null,\"duration_secs\":4.0,\"num_frames\":null,\"src_image_urls\":[\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/justintanner/apicity/d885599410f0a904c1d78ab74019e6a5fa97f00e/tests/fixtures/cat2.jpg\",\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/justintanner/apicity/d885599410f0a904c1d78ab74019e6a5fa97f00e/tests/fixtures/cat1.jpg\"],\"input_video_secs\":null,\"src_video_urls\":null,\"src_audio_urls\":null,\"src_file_urls\":null,\"src_webpage_urls\":null,\"acceleration\":null,\"adapter\":null,\"draft\":null,\"draft_source_task_id\":null},\"task_output\":null,\"moderation\":null}"
